#ASSERT `the placed salary` `the principal example's A as printed` (LIST 19000, `the principal example's new combined salary`, 21000) EQUALS `the principal example's new combined salary`

-- 3ה ¶5-¶15: for the position above 100% and up to 140%, a personal
-- supplement: B = T × (100 + Y) / 100, where T is the full salary by the
-- position in March of the year before the move (or before the absence)
-- and Y the coefficient; C = B − the new table salary, turned into a
-- percentage of the principal's combined salary.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p5 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p6 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p7 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p8 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p9 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p10 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p11 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p12 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p13 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p14 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p15
GIVEN T IS A NUMBER, Y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `B by the formula` T Y IS
    T TIMES (100 PLUS Y) DIVIDED BY 100

-- The worked steps (¶16, 1-4) multiply T by the coefficient AND the 3.4%
-- erosion (F-2023-24_tashpad_01-m); the adopted reading follows them.
GIVEN T IS A NUMBER, Y IS A NUMBER, `new table salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal supplement` T Y `new table salary` IS
    `rounded to the agora` (((T TIMES (100 PLUS Y)) DIVIDED BY 100) TIMES (1 PLUS `the erosion supplement`))
    MINUS `new table salary`

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e/p16 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_2/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_3 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_3/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_4 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3__subpara_e__cls_4/p2
`the principal example's personal supplement as printed` MEANS 4569.46
`the principal example's personal percentage as printed` MEANS 22.748

#ASSERT `the personal supplement` 20735.13 `the principal's coefficient` 20086.68 EQUALS `the principal example's personal supplement as printed`
#ASSERT TRUNC ((`the personal supplement` 20735.13 `the principal's coefficient` 20086.68 DIVIDED BY 20086.68) TIMES 100) 3 EQUALS `the principal example's personal percentage as printed`
#ASSERT NOT (`rounded to the agora` (`B by the formula` 20735.13 `the principal's coefficient`) MINUS 20086.68 EQUALS 4569.46)

§§ `נספח ה' — כתובות לפניות`

