§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples of who joins. The teachers are made up.
GIVEN `academic` IS A BOOLEAN, `certified` IS A BOOLEAN, `prior years` IS A NUMBER, `seniority` IS A NUMBER, `position` IS A NUMBER, `age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `tashpad 1 teacher`
DECIDE `a teacher with` `academic` `certified` `prior years` `seniority` `position` `age` IS
    `tashpad 1 teacher` WITH
        `teacher role`                    IS `teacher`
        `academic`                        IS `academic`
        `certified to teach`              IS `certified`
        `prior teaching years recognized` IS `prior years`
        `teaching seniority`              IS `seniority`
        `position fraction`               IS `position`
        `is an intern`                    IS FALSE
        `approved as an exception`        IS FALSE
        `age`                             IS `age`

